[241.0376, "o", "\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Dionaea (FTP/HTTP/SMB)\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Target  : 54.234.30.254\r\n  Score   : 65%\r\n  Verdict : Confirmed Honeypot\r\n\r\n  Key findings:\r\n  • [SMB] SMB dialect / native-OS emulator anomaly — SMB listener up but session setup failed: unpack requires a buffer of 2 bytes\r\n  • [FTP] FTP upload does not persist across reconnect — non-routable PASV data path; upload surface not verifiable (no response)\r\n  • [FTP] FTP welcome banner matches emulator template\r\n  • [HTTP] HTTP missing dynamic Date header — server=nginx; missing Date; headers:\r\n  • [FTP] FTP PASV/FEAT FSM conformance failure — PASV advertises non-routable 172.18.0.2\r\n  • [MULTI] Implausible multi-service honeypot buffet on single IP — 4 responsive IT lures: ftp:21, http:80, smb:445, sip:5060 (>=4 with corroboration)\r\n==========================================================\r\n\r\n"]
